===Etymology===
Possibly from {{bor|en|bug|-}}, {{bor|en|mak|-}}, or {{bor|en|ms|-}}. See "[[w:Koro (medicine)#Etymology and geographical background|Koro § Etymology and geographical background]]" at Wikipedia for a full discussion.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{lb|en|psychology}} A [[delusion]]al syndrome found in [[Malay]] and southern [[Chinese]] populations, characterized by a belief that the subject's [[penis]] will retract into the abdomen and cause death.

